{"type":"standard","title":"Mark Baisley","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mark Baisley</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q60543458","titles":{"canonical":"Mark_Baisley","normalized":"Mark Baisley","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mark Baisley</span></span>"},"pageid":59629808,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Mark_Baisley_in_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Mark_Baisley_in_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/Mark_Baisley_in_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":914,"height":1220},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376336192","tid":"dfd02ec9-b75d-11f1-8cd6-c0df8e2a4258","timestamp":"2026-09-23T14:48:44Z","description":"American politician (born 1955)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Baisley","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Baisley?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Baisley?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mark_Baisley"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Baisley","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Mark_Baisley","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Baisley?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mark_Baisley"}},"extract":"Mark Baisley is an American politician who is a state senator from Roxborough Park, Colorado. A Republican, Baisley represents Colorado's 4th Senate district. Previously, he represented Colorado House of Representatives District 39, which encompassed parts of Douglas County and all of Teller County. He is the Republican nominee in the 2026 U.S. Senate election in Colorado, challenging incumbent Democrat John Hickenlooper.","extract_html":"<p><b>Mark Baisley</b> is an American politician who is a state senator from Roxborough Park, Colorado. A Republican, Baisley represents Colorado's 4th Senate district. Previously, he represented Colorado House of Representatives District 39, which encompassed parts of Douglas County and all of Teller County. He is the Republican nominee in the 2026 U.S. Senate election in Colorado, challenging incumbent Democrat John Hickenlooper.</p>"}